      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِيْخَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A state of dilatation of the place of exit</i>
of the urine. (IAar, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <i>A tangled,
luxuriant,</i> or <i>dense, and abundant, state</i> of herbage.
(K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And <i>Vehemence,</i> or <i>intenseness,</i> of heat.
(K, TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  And <i>A</i> [<i>kind of small saucer,</i> or
<i>cup, such as is called</i>] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سُكُرُّجَة</span> [q. v.]: (K:) pl.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَيْخَاتٌ</span>. (O and K voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شُفَارِجٌ</span>.)

